    "chunk_text": "e Be \u00feam \u00fee sculon farende beon. Swa hwylc preosthades manna swa on f\u00e6relde beo mid bisceope o\u00f0\u00f0e mid o\u00f0rum men, healdan heora Be \u00feam \u00fee on litlum gyltum agylta\u00f0. Swa hwylc preost swa to late cume to tidsange o\u00f0\u00f0e to beodferse, o\u00f0\u00f0e him his ealdor hwylcne O\u00f0\u00f0e gif he hw\u00e6t forlyst o\u00f0\u00f0e tobryc\u00f0, & he sylfwilles ne cume to \u00feam bisceope o\u00f0\u00f0e to \u00feam ealdre Seo m\u00e6\u00f0ung is on \u00feam bisceope & on \u00feam ealdre \u00fee under him bi\u00f0. \u00deissum gemete ma sceal betan leuem culpam, \u00fe\u00e6t is leohtne gylt. Sy he on \u00feam d\u00e6ge \u00fee he betan scyle, ascyred fram gereorde, & on cyrcan ne beginne he sealm ne & ete ana his mete \u00e6fter bro\u00f0ra gereorde, swilce ic swa cwe\u00f0e, gif bro\u00f0ra etan to midd\u00e6ges, ete he Be \u00feam heafodgiltum. Swa hwylc preost swa on geferr\u00e6dene healices gyltes leahter gefremme, \u00fe\u00e6t is manslege, forliger, & gemune he \u00feone andryslican cwyde \u00fee se apostol cw\u00e6\u00f0, Sylle ma \u00fe\u00e6s gemetes mann on his & \u00fea hwile \u00fee he on \u00feam cwearterne beo, ne ge\u00feeode him nan of \u00fe\u00e6re geferr\u00e6dene to ne mid spr\u00e6ce, \u00deonne he ut of \u00feam cwearterne gange, gif \u00feam bisceope & \u00feam ealdre \u00feince, do he \u00feonne gyt opene & licge he, stande he \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re dura, ne sprece he wi\u00f0 n\u00e6nne man. \u00deonne hi eft ut gan, licge he astreht,",
